From a4bcce5fd63baeea6138ad68b64167c1b887cffd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olapade Quadri <quadriolapade@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:57:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(mvp): implement modular engines and role-aware
 operational dashboard ecosystem

- Decomposition into 5 isolated engines in @cultivanode/shared with unit tests:
  * ai-assistant (grounding, chemical guardrails, prompt builder)
  * agronomy (catalogues, GAP schedules, spray standards)
  * inputs (fertiliser, spray planner, weather alerts, farm-books)
  * cancellation-disputes (tiers, penalties, arbitration, agent bookings)
  * ledger-escrow (double-entry cryptographic hash-chained ledger, escrow lock/release)
  * auth-jwt and api-gateway (stateless HS256 tokens, rate-limiting, error mapping)
- REST API gateway endpoints for each engine under /api/engines/*
- Role-aware operational dashboard ecosystem and 18 priority pilot screens:
  * Farmer: Operational Home, 5-Step Service Request Wizard, Job Details, Visual Lifecycle Tracker
  * Provider: Opportunity Feed, Job Request Acceptance, GPS Check-In, Multi-stage Proof Submission
  * Field Agent: Console, Assisted Farmer Onboarding Wizard, Assisted Booking Flow
  * Operations & Admin: Operations Control Centre, Jobs Console, 360 User Dossier, Verification Queue, Dispute Evidence-Review Workstation, Audit Log, Integrations Dashboard
- Multi-role workspace switcher with persistent cookie-based context resolution
